  "keyFeatures": [
    "Git-based workflow with automatic deployment on push",
    "Rich MDX component library (cards, callouts, steps, tabs, code blocks)",
    "AI-assisted writing and editing with Claude, ChatGPT, and Cursor integration",
    "Built-in API reference page generation",
    "Custom domain support",
    "Dark and light mode with full brand customization",
    "Local preview via CLI",
    "MCP (Model Context Protocol) support for AI tools"
